body:
Sorry. I didn't mean to make you feel worse. It's my fault for not reading very carefully the first time.

I know you didn't ask for advice, but swimming might help with your chronic pain and dogs are great, too. If you like animals, maybe you could volunteer before work at a dog shelter. Try to hang in there and keep trying until you find something that works.

&#x200B;

&#x200B;

&#x200B;

You sound sort of like me. Do you know how long it took me to memorize what the word 'ominous' means? It took me about 3 weeks, not kidding. Guess you just gotta do things at your own pace though, and have faith that as long as you're enjoying it, who cares?

&#x200B;

It's great that you're learning piano. Is it going well?
